; An assertion sees the postings dated before it, by their own dates, within
; one entry too.

2024-01-01 Deposit, cleared on the 5th
    Assets:Checking     $10.00  ; date:2024-01-05
    Equity:Opening

2024-01-02 Before the deposit cleared
    Assets:Checking      $0.00 = $0.00
    Equity:Opening

2024-01-03 Transfer, the first leg cleared later
    Assets:Savings      $10.00  ; date:2024-01-09
    Assets:Savings       $5.00 = $5.00
    Equity:Opening
